          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "coach_paldea_rival_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "61B1A8DF47B06FA3",
      "text": "听说蓝莓学园\\n也有四天王！\\c\\n他们会用什么宝可梦呢！？\\n嗯～好在意啊！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
